3mfthumb (1.2.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: -f now shades the surface colour per face, and
    option values may be written joined to their flag (-z90, -s128).

 -- Henry Kroll III <nospam@thenerdshow.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 -0800

3mfthumb (1.2.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: previews for .glb (binary glTF) models, STL
    rendering, a writable thumbnail cache, colour and camera options, and
    the 3mfthumb-kde plugin for Dolphin.

 -- Henry Kroll III <nospam@thenerdshow.com>  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 00:00:00 -0800

3mfthumb (1.2.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release: install to /usr/bin, which is the only location
    Nautilus' bubblewrap thumbnail sandbox can reach, and drop the GResource
    overlay that made Nautilus hang at startup.
  * Fix file:// URI decoding, which wrote no thumbnail at all.

 -- Henry Kroll III <nospam@thenerdshow.com>  Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:00:00 -0800

